WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:03.204
One canal handles about
12 percent of world trade.

00:00:03.314 --> 00:00:05.424
What if the Red Sea route closed for good?

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:09.780
Ships from Asia to Europe normally pass
through the Red Sea and the Suez Canal.

00:00:09.995 --> 00:00:11.545
Since late 2023,

00:00:11.855 --> 00:00:16.015
attacks on ships by Yemen's Houthis pushed
many carriers onto the long way round

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:16.801
Africa.

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:20.841
The detour round the Cape of Good Hope
adds roughly ten days and thousands of

00:00:20.841 --> 00:00:21.511
kilometres.

00:00:21.761 --> 00:00:25.051
India's trade with Europe and the
American east coast takes the hit:

00:00:25.521 --> 00:00:28.011
higher freight,
delays and insurance costs.

00:00:28.162 --> 00:00:32.272
The Indian Navy sent warships to guard
merchant ships in the Arabian Sea.

00:00:32.327 --> 00:00:34.077
Should India help guard the sea lanes?

00:00:34.227 --> 00:00:34.857
Comment.

